    "chunk_text": "2. Section 3 of the Licensing of Shipping Agents, FreightForwarders, Non- Vessel Operating Common Carriers andContainer Operators Act, No. 10 of 1972 is hereby amendedin subsection (5) thereof as follows:-\n\n(2)by the addition at the end of the paragraph (e) ofthat subsection, of the following new paragraph:-\n\n\u201c(f) a charge, levy and tariff imposed by therelevant service providers of shipping agents,freight forwarders, non-vessel operatingcommon carriers and container operators forthe services rendered by them, and regulatingthe procedure of imposing and collecting suchcharge, levy and tariff .\u201d.\n\n3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendmentof section 3of Act,No. 10 of1972\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n2 Licensing of Shipping Agents, Freight Forwarders,Non-Vessel Operating Common Carriers andContainer Operators (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
