    "chunk_size_bytes": 1901,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Association ofProfessional Bankers - Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2023.\n\n3. (1) The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be \u2014\n\nShort title\n\nPreamble\n\nIncorporationof theAssociationofProfessionalBankers-Sri Lanka\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\n25\n\n2Association of Professional Bankers-Sri Lanka(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(a) to undertake, promote and facilitate studies in thefield of Banking and Financial Services within oroutside Sri Lanka ;\n\n(b) to research and submit proposals to regulatoryauthorities on the maintenance and development of asound banking structure;\n\n(c) to offer prizes and scholarships or any other awardsencouraging studies and research in the field ofBanking and Financial Services and allied subjectsetc. ;\n\n(d) to organize and promote research in the field ofBanking and Financial Services and undertake studiesand research projects on contract from government,private and international agencies or institutions ;\n\n(e) to plan and organize teaching and trainingprogrammes in the field of Banking and FinancialServices ;\n\n(f) to train students and others in research methodologywith the idea of promoting knowledge and awarenessin subjects relevant to Banking and FinancialServices ;\n\n(g) to update the knowledge of its members in the fieldof Banking and Financial Services to enhance theirskills and professionalism ;\n\n(h) to create a forum at which the members and any othercould voice, comment, communicate, discuss andresolve issues of Professional and Academic intereststo its members and to assist in the formulation ofeffective policies relating to Banking and FinancialServices ;30\n\nAssociation of Professional Bankers-Sri Lanka(Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
