    "chunk_size_bytes": 2026,
    "chunk_text": "AND WHEREAS the said Institute has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Institute of DraftingTechnologists Sri Lanka Act, No. of 2022.\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nIncorporationof theInstitute ofDraftingTechnologistsSri Lanka.\n\n30\n\n2Institute of Drafting TechnologistsSri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n3. Subject to the Provisions of this Act and any otherWritten Law, the general objectives for which the BodyCorporate is constituted are hereby declared to be \u2014\n\n(a)To promote and foster the advancement of DraftingTechnology including techniques and skills thereof;\n\n(b)Subject to the Provisions of the Tertiary andVocational Education Act (No. 20 of 1990), asamended (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cTVECAct\u201d), to secure uniformity in the vocation ofDrafting Technology, and modify, supervise, adviseand control the Drafting Technology education inSri Lanka in consultation with the Tertiary andVocational Education Commission establishedunder the TVEC Act (hereinafter referred to as \u201ctheTVEC\u201d);\n\n(c)Subject to the Provisions of the TVEC Act conductand promote courses in Drafting Technologyprovided that the Body Corporate shall not at anytime exceed any authority given to it by the TVECto conduct such courses accredited by the TVECpertaining to Drafting Technology;\n\n(d)To promote the study of such branches of law as arenecessary for or relevant to the vocation andpractice of Drafting Technology;\n\n(e)To promote the acquisition, dissemination andexchange of knowledge relating to or connectedwith Drafting Technology including techniques andskills thereof by the following but not limited to:-\n\n(i)Providing a forum for the presentation of papersand for holding discussion thereon;"
