    "chunk_text": "(c) The qualifications of members to be admitted intoany of the grades of the Body Corporate shall be as specifiedin Schedule B hereto, and may be amended, added to,replaced or repealed in terms of any rules prescribed undersection 6.\n\n(e) All persons who were members of the Instituteimmediately preceding the date of the commencement ofthis Act but who have not obtained a National VocationalQualification pertaining to the vocation of DraftingTechnology as prescribed in Schedule B hereto, shall beand shall be deemed for all purposes to be Affiliate membersof the same grade, as the case may be, of the Body Corporate,and shall continue so to be, subject to the provisions of thisAct and any rules prescribed under section 6.\n\nManagementof the affairsof the BodyCorporateandMembershipof the BodyCorporate\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n35\n\n8Institute of Drafting TechnologistsSri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n(f) Affiliate members of the Body Corporate who obtainthe relevant National Vocational Qualification as prescribedin Schedule B hereto any time after the commencement ofthis Act, shall on application be re-registered as Corporatemembers or Non-Corporate members, as the case may be.\n\n(3) (a) The office bearers shall be elected from Corporatemembers and Affiliate members (excluding AffiliateAssociate members and Affiliate Probationer members) whohave maintained the membership and have been part of theExecutive Committee for the past two years immediatelypreceding the election of the Executive Committee.\n\n(b) The nominations received for posts of the officebearers of the Executive Committee shall be proposed at theannual general meeting by a sub- committee appointed bythe Executive Committee provided that no office bearer ofthe Executive Committee of the Body Corporate shall holdoffice for more than three (03) years during any one (01)term."
